{'symbol': 'GD', 'date': '2021-12-01 15:00:00', 'title': 'GENERAL DYNAMICS BOARD DECLARES DIVIDEND', 'text': "RESTON, VA., DEC. 1, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF GENERAL DYNAMICS (NYSE: GD) TODAY DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $1.19 PER SHARE ON THE COMPANY'S COMMON STOCK, PAYABLE FEBRUARY 4, 2022, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON JANUARY 14, 2022."}